      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```python\nimport numpy as np\n\n\ndef gd_step(A, y, w, lr):\n    A, y, w = np.array(A, dtype=float), np.array(y, dtype=float), np.array(w, dtype=float)\n    grad = 2 / len(y) * A.T @ (A @ w - y)\n    return (w - lr * grad).round(4).tolist()\n\nA = [[1, 0.5], [1, 1.5], [1, 2.0]]\ny = [2.0, 4.0, 5.0]\nw = [0.0, 0.0]\nfor _ in range(3):\n    w = gd_step(A, y, w, 0.1)\n    print(w)\n```"
